      "content": "Previous Next Shri Samrat Choudhary Honourable Chief Minister 0612-2222079 About Us The Cabinet Secretariat Department is an important department of the State Government. In addition to organizing a meeting of the Council of Ministers, coordination among all the departments of the State Government is the main function of this department. This department is responsible for the formation of executive rules related to the execution of works at various levels in the state government. In addition, the responsibility of execution the protocol related work on behalf of the state government is also allocated to this department. Read More... Key Contacts Shri Pratyaya Amrit, I.A.S. Chief Secretary Phone 0612-2215804 Email cs-bihar@nic.in Md. Sohail, I.A.S. Secretary Phone 0612-2215246 Email secy_cabsec@bihar.gov.in Fax 2217698 Shri Arvind Kumar Verma, I.A.S. Special Secretary Phone 0612-2215055 Email dscabinet78@gmail.com Smt. Anita Singh, B.A.S. Special Secretary Phone 0612-2215129 Mobile 9473197670 Mahendra Pd Yadav , B.S.S. Joint Secretary Mobile 9162420473 Srikant Gudia , B.S.S. Deputy Secretary Phone 2217771 Fax 2217771 - Additional Secretary . . Phone Directory Latest News अपर मुख्य सचिव / प्रधान सचिव / सचिव स्‍तर के पदाधिकारियों को जिला का प्रभारी बनाने के संबंध में जिला का प्रभारी मंत्री-सह-अध्यक्ष मनोनीत करने के सम्बन्ध में। Allocation of work of government departments to the Chief Minister and Ministers. Regarding internship program by Bihar State Archives Directorate Patna. Regarding reservation of auditorium building in the records building complex of Bihar State Archives Directorate Patna for Government of India State Government private organization non-government organization and General public. Representing Colonial Resistance from Archival Texts (1832 - 1916) Series-I (Digitized Collection) Highlights Image-Link Directorate of Rajbhasa Image-Link Image-Link Image-Link Bihar State Archives Directorate Image-Link Important Links Notice Board R